## Architecture mapping (web → native)

  useDrives(vehicleId)      → DriveScoreClientFeed (GET /drives?vehicle_id, get_api_v1_drives) — PRIMARY read
  useDriveScore(vehicleId)  → DriveScoreClientFeed.FetchScoreAsync (GET /drives/score, get_api_v1_drives_score) — best-effort
                              (web retry:false; transport failure degrades to client-computed averages)
  scoreDrive(drive)         → ScoreMath.ScoreDrive (1:1: eff/40, smooth/30, speed/30; grade ladder 90/80/70/60/50)
  avgScores/overall/trend   → DriveScoreProjection.Project (api score wins, else client average)
  filteredDrives (30d)      → DriveScoreProjection (WindowDays=30; StartTs ∈ [now-30d, now])
  units (Wh/km, km, km/h)   → UnitFormatters/UnitConverters at the render boundary only (SI on disk)
  pagination (10/page)      → DriveScoreProjection.DrivesPerPage + ViewModel.Page + TsPagination

